    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "order": 120,
    "anchor": "main-engagement",
    "summary": "This part of the [team pairing system](vsdata:core-rule/event-companion.pairing-system) uses 3 secret picks, each revealed by both teams at the same time:\n\n1. Each team picks 1 member as its Defender.\n2. Each team picks 2 other members as Attackers to face the opposing Defender.\n3. Teams choose which of the 2 opposing Attackers their Defender will play. This sets 2 games.\n\nEach Defender then picks a layout. The 2 refused Attackers play each other, using Layout A in round 1, B in round 2 and C in round 3, then repeating that cycle.",
